1
00:00:10,566 --> 00:00:11,450
Where are you going?

2
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,199
Khao Yai!

3
00:00:13,519 --> 00:00:14,721
I just want to be with you.

4
00:00:14,947 --> 00:00:17,968
Even though you'll get back with Jeen tomorrow,

5
00:00:18,001 --> 00:00:20,012
I'll still be happy for today anyway.

6
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:22,414
So, you posted those pics...

7
00:00:22,827 --> 00:00:24,024
just to get people to like you?

8
00:00:24,437 --> 00:00:26,871
If that's all you want,
you can deactivate your account.

9
00:00:27,129 --> 00:00:28,172
I can do it for you.

10
00:00:29,594 --> 00:00:30,355
Where is Tee?

11
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,113
Hey, is he over there?

12
00:00:33,901 --> 00:00:35,436
Tee!

13
00:00:37,127 --> 00:00:38,146
Fuse!

14
00:00:38,492 --> 00:00:39,680
Hey!

15
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,626
Tee!

16
00:00:56,987 --> 00:00:58,099
Tee, are you okay?

17
00:00:59,183 --> 00:01:00,927
You good? Are you okay?

18
00:01:02,466 --> 00:01:03,666
Tee, you okay?

19
00:01:05,066 --> 00:01:05,866
I'm okay.

20
00:01:07,239 --> 00:01:08,972
I'm just practicing diving.

21
00:01:09,393 --> 00:01:10,193
Oh.

22
00:01:11,966 --> 00:01:13,266
You totally scared me.

23
00:01:19,652 --> 00:01:20,819
Are you worried about me?

24
00:01:30,338 --> 00:01:33,132
We'll leave then. Bye.

25
00:01:42,013 --> 00:01:43,679
Don't play like this again.

26
00:01:51,073 --> 00:01:51,873
Okay.

27
00:04:18,286 --> 00:04:19,219
I'm sorry.

28
00:04:30,253 --> 00:04:31,419
Why are you apologizing?

29
00:04:33,419 --> 00:04:35,119
For frightening you.

30
00:04:36,419 --> 00:04:37,519
Are you mad at me?

31
00:04:40,953 --> 00:04:42,019
I'm not mad at you.

32
00:04:44,258 --> 00:04:45,892
I'm just letting my mind wander.

33
00:04:59,619 --> 00:05:00,886
When you disappeared,

34
00:05:01,419 --> 00:05:02,619
I was so shocked.

35
00:05:04,019 --> 00:05:06,119
And even more so when you're drowning.

36
00:05:08,906 --> 00:05:09,706
I...

37
00:05:12,599 --> 00:05:14,932
I only thought that I had to save you.

38
00:05:16,486 --> 00:05:17,453
You must be fine.

39
00:05:20,832 --> 00:05:23,466
If not, I'll...

40
00:05:30,253 --> 00:05:31,286
I'm here.

41
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:35,826
I'm fine.

42
00:05:41,753 --> 00:05:42,953
I already told you.

43
00:05:45,819 --> 00:05:47,319
If you want me to stay,

44
00:05:48,086 --> 00:05:48,919
I won't go anywhere.

45
00:05:53,686 --> 00:05:55,653
Will you stay with me forever then?

46
00:05:58,519 --> 00:05:59,319
Um.

47
00:06:34,753 --> 00:06:36,686
I brought you some snacks from Khao Yai.

48
00:06:39,319 --> 00:06:40,353
Did you go there?

49
00:06:41,419 --> 00:06:42,509
Didn't you see that?

50
00:06:42,509 --> 00:06:44,096
In his IG stories.

51
00:06:44,096 --> 00:06:46,019
His stories are a whole row of dots.

52
00:06:47,486 --> 00:06:48,319
Who did you go with?

53
00:06:49,019 --> 00:06:49,819
My family.

54
00:06:50,653 --> 00:06:51,419
You sure?

55
00:06:51,419 --> 00:06:52,219
Is that so?

56
00:06:52,619 --> 00:06:53,419
You sure?

57
00:06:54,086 --> 00:06:55,953
And Tee. Are you happy now?

58
00:07:00,432 --> 00:07:02,132
Are you that close to him?

59
00:07:02,428 --> 00:07:03,210
Yeah.

60
00:07:03,235 --> 00:07:06,403
I've known you since grade 1
but you never invite me to join your family trip.

61
00:07:06,479 --> 00:07:07,679
Because you're just a friend.

62
00:07:12,398 --> 00:07:13,991
What is Tee, then?

63
00:07:16,537 --> 00:07:18,933
I guess Tee is F...

64
00:07:20,393 --> 00:07:21,440
WB.

65
00:07:23,719 --> 00:07:25,286
FWB, my ass.

66
00:07:25,819 --> 00:07:26,985
Did you hide yourself under my bed?

67
00:07:27,078 --> 00:07:28,022
What do you mean?

68
00:07:28,492 --> 00:07:30,492
I mean friends with buffets.

69
00:07:34,666 --> 00:07:35,666
I also want to have one.

70
00:07:35,899 --> 00:07:37,266
You don't need to eat buffets.

71
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:38,299
Just eat fish instead.

72
00:07:38,933 --> 00:07:39,899
Fish?

73
00:07:40,404 --> 00:07:41,204
This fish.

74
00:07:41,634 --> 00:07:43,634
Hey, guys.

75
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:47,795
Up, up.

76
00:07:47,795 --> 00:07:48,475
Damn.

77
00:07:48,476 --> 00:07:50,476
Yay.

78
00:07:53,645 --> 00:07:54,676
Fuse.

79
00:07:54,947 --> 00:07:56,947
Hey, put me down.

80
00:08:00,593 --> 00:08:03,293
Guys, Fuse's FWB is here.

81
00:08:06,786 --> 00:08:07,586
Tee.

82
00:08:08,299 --> 00:08:09,399
Do you like buffets?

83
00:08:09,666 --> 00:08:10,633
Wit.

84
00:08:11,266 --> 00:08:12,663
What did you ask him?

85
00:08:12,885 --> 00:08:13,685
Huh?

86
00:08:13,832 --> 00:08:14,943
Why?

87
00:08:15,699 --> 00:08:16,866
Don't forget to have the snacks.

88
00:08:17,099 --> 00:08:17,899
I chose them myself.

89
00:08:17,933 --> 00:08:18,799
Hey, Tee.

90
00:08:19,133 --> 00:08:20,899
How was the Khao Yai trip with my friend?

91
00:08:20,924 --> 00:08:21,724
Do you enjoy?

92
00:08:23,533 --> 00:08:24,333
I do.

93
00:08:27,143 --> 00:08:28,686
Is my friend cute?

94
00:08:33,466 --> 00:08:34,266
He's cute.

95
00:08:39,482 --> 00:08:41,076
There you go.

96
00:08:41,162 --> 00:08:42,233
Look at these.

97
00:08:42,258 --> 00:08:43,956
They're exactly the same.

98
00:08:44,581 --> 00:08:46,581
They're the same one.

99
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:50,365
Hey.

100
00:08:50,969 --> 00:08:52,399
By the way, on the Khao Yai trip...

101
00:08:52,572 --> 00:08:53,805
did you do the same thing
you did behind the building?

102
00:08:54,266 --> 00:08:54,968
Huh? What?

103
00:08:54,968 --> 00:08:55,383
What did they do?

104
00:08:55,408 --> 00:08:56,208
Behind the building?

105
00:08:56,599 --> 00:08:57,466
Hey, what did they do?

106
00:08:57,599 --> 00:08:58,499
Spill the tea.

107
00:08:58,524 --> 00:08:59,916
Behind the building,...

108
00:09:00,332 --> 00:09:02,583
I saw them together and then...

109
00:09:02,656 --> 00:09:03,769
Ouch.

110
00:09:04,057 --> 00:09:04,857
Oh.

111
00:09:05,099 --> 00:09:05,799
That's harsh.

112
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:06,633
So harsh.

113
00:09:06,899 --> 00:09:08,299
Why is he acting like this?

114
00:09:09,144 --> 00:09:09,944
What's wrong with him?

115
00:09:14,392 --> 00:09:15,458
Go back to your seat.

116
00:09:16,625 --> 00:09:17,492
Fine.

117
00:09:17,517 --> 00:09:18,263
Okay.

118
00:09:40,330 --> 00:09:41,828
What did you just do?

119
00:09:45,528 --> 00:09:47,186
Why did you bring your bag?

120
00:09:52,070 --> 00:09:53,070
I move to different rooms for every class.

121
00:09:54,303 --> 00:09:56,196
Why aren't you in class yet?

122
00:09:56,744 --> 00:09:58,010
Why did you stop by my room?

123
00:09:58,649 --> 00:09:59,683
I just want to see you.

124
00:10:01,643 --> 00:10:02,843
If I'm bothering you,

125
00:10:03,543 --> 00:10:04,477
I'll leave.

126
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:08,410
Um.

127
00:10:08,636 --> 00:10:10,636
Do you think you're cute when acting sulky?

128
00:10:16,530 --> 00:10:19,164
Wanna grab dinner this evening?

129
00:10:23,118 --> 00:10:23,918
Sure.

130
00:10:34,584 --> 00:10:35,618
You promised.

131
00:10:51,684 --> 00:10:53,643
Hey, Tee!

132
00:10:54,518 --> 00:10:55,396
Tee!

133
00:10:56,015 --> 00:10:57,564
We must go now.

134
00:11:02,984 --> 00:11:03,984
I have to go.

135
00:11:09,584 --> 00:11:10,584
Have a good day.

136
00:11:13,018 --> 00:11:13,818
Okay.

137
00:11:19,284 --> 00:11:20,318
See you this evening.

138
00:11:20,884 --> 00:11:21,684
Bye.

139
00:11:52,684 --> 00:11:54,018
Did you double-booked yourself?

140
00:11:56,651 --> 00:11:57,384
What?

141
00:11:57,384 --> 00:11:58,184
Ouch.

142
00:11:58,518 --> 00:12:01,118
Nai asked me to tell you that
you have a practice this evening.

143
00:12:04,918 --> 00:12:05,718
Huh?

144
00:12:08,251 --> 00:12:10,884
Wanna grab dinner this evening?

145
00:12:11,284 --> 00:12:12,218
You promised.

146
00:12:34,688 --> 00:12:35,488
Hey, wait.

147
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,000
Yes?

148
00:12:38,643 --> 00:12:39,810
You have a practice today, don't you?

149
00:12:40,565 --> 00:12:42,521
Can I skip today's practice?

150
00:12:42,521 --> 00:12:44,031
Can I go to Siam with my friend?

151
00:12:44,448 --> 00:12:44,948
Why would you go there?

152
00:12:45,109 --> 00:12:46,342
I want to watch a movie.

153
00:12:47,587 --> 00:12:50,087
Don't even think about it, go back to practice.

154
00:12:55,510 --> 00:12:56,310
Come here.

155
00:12:57,689 --> 00:12:59,122
Hey, my shirt will tear.

156
00:13:00,413 --> 00:13:01,779
Take your drum major mace out

157
00:13:04,731 --> 00:13:05,798
It's too far.

158
00:13:09,207 --> 00:13:10,073
Take it out.

159
00:13:15,165 --> 00:13:16,798
If you came to practice more often,

160
00:13:17,079 --> 00:13:18,579
it wouldn't be kept so far.

161
00:13:44,315 --> 00:13:45,348
Are you okay?

162
00:13:46,052 --> 00:13:49,118
You are so careless.
What would you do if I weren't here?

163
00:13:51,169 --> 00:13:51,969
I'm sorry.

164
00:13:54,452 --> 00:13:55,252
Hey.

165
00:14:02,998 --> 00:14:03,798
Does it hurt?

166
00:14:13,629 --> 00:14:14,429
Where are you going?

167
00:14:15,137 --> 00:14:15,789
To practice.

168
00:14:16,136 --> 00:14:17,605
Why? Mhek is already there.

169
00:14:17,738 --> 00:14:19,372
Hey, I'm the leader of cheer club.

170
00:14:19,423 --> 00:14:20,368
Don't be stubborn.

171
00:14:21,152 --> 00:14:23,250
Look at your wound. Stay right here.

172
00:14:24,173 --> 00:14:25,969
Let me get you patched up.

173
00:14:28,623 --> 00:14:29,589
Can you do it?

174
00:14:30,130 --> 00:14:30,930
Easy peasy.

175
00:14:34,997 --> 00:14:36,130
First, remove the dust.

176
00:14:41,530 --> 00:14:43,464
Oh, isn't that too much?

177
00:14:44,430 --> 00:14:45,825
Of course.

178
00:14:46,615 --> 00:14:47,884
If you don't recover in time,

179
00:14:48,144 --> 00:14:49,502
what will you do?

180
00:14:50,052 --> 00:14:51,186
Let it get infected?

181
00:14:52,169 --> 00:14:53,909
That way, you can't drag me to practice.

182
00:14:55,536 --> 00:14:56,702
I still can drag you.

183
00:14:59,490 --> 00:15:00,480
Thank you.

184
00:15:01,323 --> 00:15:02,367
If it weren't for you,

185
00:15:02,392 --> 00:15:04,261
my head would be cracked open.

186
00:15:25,309 --> 00:15:26,743
Is there something on my face?

187
00:15:28,409 --> 00:15:29,209
No.

188
00:15:33,423 --> 00:15:36,523
You must clean the wound everyday,
so you'll recover soon.

189
00:15:37,735 --> 00:15:38,535
Um.

190
00:15:38,664 --> 00:15:40,299
One more thing.

191
00:15:41,104 --> 00:15:44,035
I think you should take a break.
I'm really worried about you.

192
00:15:46,516 --> 00:15:47,716
What if you slack off?

193
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:50,103
I won't slack off. I promise.

194
00:16:10,583 --> 00:16:11,383
Rodtang.

195
00:16:17,103 --> 00:16:18,036
Thanks.

196
00:16:29,830 --> 00:16:30,630
Hey.

197
00:16:32,016 --> 00:16:33,116
Hurry up.

198
00:16:33,570 --> 00:16:34,570
What are you doing?

199
00:16:37,676 --> 00:16:38,476
Come on.

200
00:16:45,650 --> 00:16:47,483
Hey, Nai will see it.

201
00:16:49,290 --> 00:16:50,090
Damn.

202
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:55,949
The big day is around the corner.

203
00:16:56,026 --> 00:16:56,704
You should practice.

204
00:16:59,159 --> 00:17:00,662
Uh...

205
00:17:00,696 --> 00:17:02,213
Your mace is over there.

206
00:17:03,266 --> 00:17:04,332
Someone already brought it.

207
00:17:21,848 --> 00:17:23,851
(Sorry, I have a practice.)

208
00:17:23,851 --> 00:17:27,068
(Let's do it another time.)

209
00:17:32,376 --> 00:17:36,010
(Sorry, I have a practice.)
(Let's do it another time.)

210
00:18:03,326 --> 00:18:04,126
Hey.

211
00:18:05,919 --> 00:18:06,753
Fuse.

212
00:18:08,812 --> 00:18:10,112
Are you the head drum major?

213
00:18:10,172 --> 00:18:11,338
Are you the assistant drum major?

214
00:18:12,519 --> 00:18:13,319
Um.

215
00:18:15,393 --> 00:18:17,026
If I knew it's you,

216
00:18:17,153 --> 00:18:18,686
I wouldn't skip any practice.

217
00:18:19,219 --> 00:18:20,019
Whoa.

218
00:18:20,953 --> 00:18:22,518
Let's practice.

219
00:18:22,518 --> 00:18:23,018
Hey.

220
00:18:23,253 --> 00:18:25,919
We must be the coolest
drum major in the school's history.

221
00:18:26,165 --> 00:18:26,965
Let's get it.

222
00:18:35,721 --> 00:18:36,854
You're really good at it.

223
00:18:37,054 --> 00:18:38,193
You can do everything I taught you.

224
00:18:38,580 --> 00:18:39,775
Hmm.

225
00:18:41,443 --> 00:18:42,277
I have a secret.

226
00:18:42,577 --> 00:18:43,177
What is it?

227
00:18:43,177 --> 00:18:44,119
Wanna know?

228
00:18:44,119 --> 00:18:44,619
Yeah.

229
00:18:46,143 --> 00:18:47,743
My IQ is 180.

230
00:18:48,377 --> 00:18:49,377
Maybe not.

231
00:18:50,804 --> 00:18:51,604
What?

232
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:54,096
Come on.

233
00:18:59,206 --> 00:19:01,401
(I just finished my extra class. I'm coming.)

234
00:19:05,716 --> 00:19:07,050
Who are you talking to?

235
00:19:08,056 --> 00:19:08,856
Nothing.

236
00:19:09,349 --> 00:19:10,149
Just a peek.

237
00:19:17,016 --> 00:19:17,816
Hey.

238
00:19:25,801 --> 00:19:26,820
Hello, Tee.

239
00:19:38,143 --> 00:19:38,990
Nai, why are you here?

240
00:19:39,202 --> 00:19:39,783
What?

241
00:19:40,734 --> 00:19:41,826
You little brat.

242
00:19:45,949 --> 00:19:46,773
Hey.

243
00:19:46,773 --> 00:19:47,794
Don't.

244
00:19:49,476 --> 00:19:51,011
That's too tight.

245
00:19:51,231 --> 00:19:52,250
What's wrong with you?

246
00:19:53,244 --> 00:19:54,469
Hey.

247
00:19:54,494 --> 00:19:55,410
It's uncomfortable.

248
00:19:55,830 --> 00:19:57,270
You didn't look uncomfortable a moment ago.

249
00:19:57,295 --> 00:19:59,295
Did you finish the extra class?

250
00:20:00,549 --> 00:20:01,783
I also finished my practice.

251
00:20:01,983 --> 00:20:02,816
Let's grab something to eat.

252
00:20:03,409 --> 00:20:04,243
Can I join you two?

253
00:20:05,789 --> 00:20:06,623
Sure, let's go.

254
00:20:07,957 --> 00:20:09,024
Nai, will you come with us?

255
00:20:09,216 --> 00:20:10,783
Nai doesn't want to go. It's fine.

256
00:20:11,183 --> 00:20:11,983
I'll go.

257
00:20:12,449 --> 00:20:13,249
Don't go.

258
00:20:13,476 --> 00:20:14,476
He asked me.

259
00:20:15,216 --> 00:20:15,849
No need to go.

260
00:20:16,022 --> 00:20:17,122
Why would you go with us?

261
00:20:17,883 --> 00:20:18,749
Because he invited me.

262
00:20:19,483 --> 00:20:20,283
You don't have to go.

263
00:20:21,749 --> 00:20:22,549
He invited me.

264
00:20:23,583 --> 00:20:24,383
Just don't go.

265
00:20:25,049 --> 00:20:25,849
I'll go.

266
00:20:43,549 --> 00:20:44,983
Pizza delivery.

267
00:20:46,583 --> 00:20:47,483
I didn't order it.

268
00:20:48,949 --> 00:20:50,216
A promotion for today.

269
00:20:50,669 --> 00:20:51,469
Buy one, get one free.

270
00:20:52,169 --> 00:20:53,536
But if you are my boyfriend,

271
00:20:54,749 --> 00:20:55,616
you can have it for free.

272
00:20:58,776 --> 00:20:59,876
I don't want to eat it.

273
00:21:03,449 --> 00:21:04,249
What?

274
00:21:05,449 --> 00:21:07,349
So, what do you want to eat?

275
00:21:07,655 --> 00:21:08,555
I'll order it for you.

276
00:21:10,363 --> 00:21:11,196
I don't feel like eating.

277
00:21:12,836 --> 00:21:14,049
And I want to be alone.

278
00:21:15,936 --> 00:21:16,902
You can leave now.

279
00:21:22,616 --> 00:21:23,809
Okay, fine.

280
00:21:25,083 --> 00:21:28,216
Well, can you post any pic tonight?

281
00:21:28,669 --> 00:21:31,169
Just post anything, I'll be the first who like it.

282
00:21:31,249 --> 00:21:32,049
No.

283
00:21:35,869 --> 00:21:37,269
I won't post any more pictures.

284
00:21:42,783 --> 00:21:43,583
What?

285
00:21:44,283 --> 00:21:45,083
Why?

286
00:21:46,616 --> 00:21:47,416
Book.

287
00:22:27,539 --> 00:22:29,973
(Tee 0 - 1 Rodtang)
Fuse, that restaurant is good.

288
00:22:30,973 --> 00:22:31,773
Really?

289
00:22:35,506 --> 00:22:36,973
(Tee 1 - 1 Rodtang)
Careful, watch where you're walking.

290
00:22:38,593 --> 00:22:40,287
Nai, you okay?

