Is Tee going straight home?

575
00:40:52,119 --> 00:40:54,919
Yeah, he is going home with me.

576
00:40:58,060 --> 00:41:02,139
Okay, I have to go now.

577
00:41:02,739 --> 00:41:04,958
Don't forget the snacks. Bye.

578
00:41:19,126 --> 00:41:20,692
How was your talk with Jeen?

579
00:41:22,859 --> 00:41:23,692
It was fun.

580
00:41:25,626 --> 00:41:26,826
She's talkative.

581
00:41:30,526 --> 00:41:32,492
You can pretend to sleep next time.

582
00:41:35,326 --> 00:41:36,726
Will there be next time?

583
00:41:43,792 --> 00:41:44,429
But...

584
00:41:45,255 --> 00:41:48,243
Jeen is lovely. She seems to like you a lot.

585
00:41:51,059 --> 00:41:53,392
You didn't get that matter wrong, did you?

586
00:41:55,092 --> 00:41:56,692
You guys should talk things out nicely.

587
00:41:59,592 --> 00:42:01,926
I don't think that would help.

588
00:42:10,992 --> 00:42:12,892
It's not about her now.

589
00:42:16,392 --> 00:42:17,259
It's my fault.

590
00:42:26,526 --> 00:42:30,826
I think I'll break up with her.

591
00:43:17,192 --> 00:43:18,126
In a few hours,

592
00:43:18,292 --> 00:43:20,326
the friendly match will start.

593
00:43:20,526 --> 00:43:23,659
Let's team up. One, two, three.

594
00:43:25,859 --> 00:43:27,092
Aren't you a bit too handsome today?

595
00:43:27,518 --> 00:43:29,552
I think I'm handsome everyday.

596
00:43:29,912 --> 00:43:31,746
Can I persue you, the head of cheer club?

597
00:43:32,092 --> 00:43:33,326
Why don't you sit with your friends?

598
00:43:33,492 --> 00:43:34,592
I want to sit here.

599
00:43:34,792 --> 00:43:35,892
Can I sit here?
